 "html": "<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(48px,6vw,80px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,72px);align-items:center\">\n<div><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6E6C8A\"><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#6E6C8A\">Home</a><span>/</span><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">Security and compliance</span></nav>\n<h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px, 2.2vw + 26px, 58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 0;max-width:14ch\">How we keep your money safe<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:clamp(17px, 0.2vw + 16px, 19px);line-height:1.55;color:#4C4A66;margin:24px 0 0;max-width:52ch\">Funds held with licensed partner institutions, every business verified before it goes live, every payment screened, and security controls independently attested under SOC 2 Type I.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:40px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#131126;color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#5ED6B4\"></span>SOC 2 Type I attested</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:40px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#FFB224\"></span>Licensed partner institutions</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:40px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#A79EFF\"></span>KYB on every customer</span>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A;margin:22px 0 0\">Updated October 2026</p></div>\n<div style=\"width:100%;max-width:520px;justify-self:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(16px,3vw,28px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(20px,3vw,32px);border-radius:28px;background:#131126;color:#fff\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;flex:none;width:84px;aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;color:#131126;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"/badges/aicpa-soc.png\" alt=\"AICPA SOC badge\" style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:60px;height:60px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);object-fit:contain\"></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B4B1D0\">INDEPENDENTLY ATTESTED</div><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.05;margin-top:8px\">SOC 2 Type I</div><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#B4B1D0\">AICPA Trust Services Criteria for security.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:18px clamp(16px,2.4vw,24px) 20px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#4C4A66\"><span style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#5ED6B4\"></span>OUR PARTNERS ARE CERTIFIED TO</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:14px\"><figure style=\"margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><img src=\"/badges/soc2-type2.png\" alt=\"AICPA SOC 2 Type 2 certification held by ElementPay partners\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:96px;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:contain\"><figcaption style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.3;color:#4C4A66;text-align:center\">AICPA SOC 2 Type 2</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><img src=\"/badges/soc1-type2.png\" alt=\"AICPA SOC 1 Type 2 certification held by ElementPay partners\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:96px;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:contain\"><figcaption style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.3;color:#4C4A66;text-align:center\">AICPA SOC 1 Type 2</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><img src=\"/badges/iso27001.png\" alt=\"ISO 27001:2022 certification held by ElementPay partners\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:96px;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:contain\"><figcaption style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.3;color:#4C4A66;text-align:center\">ISO 27001:2022</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><img src=\"/badges/gdpr.png\" alt=\"GDPR compliant certification held by ElementPay partners\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:96px;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:contain\"><figcaption style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.3;color:#4C4A66;text-align:center\">GDPR compliant</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Four layers of protection<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:32px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 440px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;min-height:240px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#5ED6B4;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#131126\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"22\" y2=\"22\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"11\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"11\"></line><line x1=\"14\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"11\"></line><line x1=\"18\" x2=\"18\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"11\"></line><polygon points=\"12 2 20 7 4 7\"></polygon></svg></span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6E6C8A\">01</span></div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Funds held with licensed partners</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Customer money is held with licensed partner institutions in the markets where we operate, kept separate from ElementPay's own operating funds.</p></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;min-height:240px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#FFB224;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#131126\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 10h2\"></path><path d=\"M16 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M6.17 15a3 3 0 0 1 5.66 0\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"></circle><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6E6C8A\">02</span></div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Business verification</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">We verify each company's registration, directors, beneficial owners and use case before it can send or receive money.</p></div></div></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 440px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;min-height:240px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#FF6A55;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#131126\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35\"></path><path d=\"M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66\"></path></svg></span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6E6C8A\">03</span></div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Transaction monitoring</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Payments are screened against sanctions lists and monitored for unusual activity, in fiat and in stablecoins.</p></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;min-height:240px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#3B2ED3;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6E6C8A\">04</span></div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Encryption and access control</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Data is encrypted in transit and at rest. Staff access is limited by role, protected by multi-factor authentication and logged.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\">\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(24px,4vw,56px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(28px,4vw,56px);border-radius:28px;background:#131126;color:#F6F4EF\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:104px;aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;color:#131126;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"/badges/aicpa-soc.png\" alt=\"AICPA SOC badge\" style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:60px;height:60px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);object-fit:contain\"></div></div>\n<div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B4B1D0\"><span style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#5ED6B4\"></span>INDEPENDENT ATTESTATION</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0;margin-top:14px;color:#fff\">SOC 2 Type I attested<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#B4B1D0;margin:16px 0 0;max-width:52ch\">An independent auditor has examined the design of ElementPay's security controls against the AICPA Trust Services Criteria for security. The report is available to customers and prospects under NDA.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px\"><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:48px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFB224;color:#131126;font-weight:600;font-size:15px\" class=\"dp-1sn2npj\">Request the SOC 2 report</a></div></div>\n</div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#4C4A66\"><span style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#5ED6B4\"></span>OUR PARTNERS</div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:12px 0 0;max-width:20ch\">Built on independently certified infrastructure<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h2></div>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#4C4A66;margin:0;max-width:46ch\">The banking and infrastructure partners that hold funds and process payments for ElementPay carry the certifications below.</p></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 440px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px\"><img src=\"/badges/soc2-type2.png\" alt=\"AICPA SOC 2 Type 2 badge\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:96px;height:96px;object-fit:contain\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">AICPA SOC 2 Type 2</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Security, availability and confidentiality controls tested over a period of operation.</p></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px\"><img src=\"/badges/soc1-type2.png\" alt=\"AICPA SOC 1 Type 2 badge\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:96px;height:96px;object-fit:contain\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">AICPA SOC 1 Type 2</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Controls over financial reporting tested over a period of operation.</p></div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 440px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px\"><img src=\"/badges/iso27001.png\" alt=\"ISO/IEC 27001:2022 badge\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:96px;height:96px;object-fit:contain\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">ISO/IEC 27001:2022</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">An audited information security management system.</p></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px\"><img src=\"/badges/gdpr.png\" alt=\"GDPR compliant badge\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:96px;height:96px;object-fit:contain\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">GDPR compliant</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Personal data handled under the EU General Data Protection Regulation.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#6E6C8A;margin:14px 4px 0\">These certifications are held by ElementPay's partners. ElementPay's own attestation is SOC 2 Type I.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Compliance built into every payment<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#4C4A66;margin:16px 0 0;max-width:60ch\">Our compliance programme follows a risk-based approach to anti-money-laundering and counter-terrorist financing, applied before onboarding and on every transaction after it.</p>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#EEEDFB;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B2ED3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Know your business</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:8px 0 0\">Company documents, directors and ultimate beneficial owners checked at onboarding, and reviewed when risk changes.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#EEEDFB;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B2ED3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m3 17 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m3 7 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M13 6h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 12h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 18h8\"></path></svg></span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Sanctions and PEP screening</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:8px 0 0\">Customers, owners and counterparties screened against global sanctions and politically exposed persons lists.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#EEEDFB;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B2ED3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35\"></path><path d=\"M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66\"></path></svg></span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Ongoing monitoring</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:8px 0 0\">Rules and reviews that flag unusual patterns, with escalation and reporting to authorities where required.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#EEEDFB;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B2ED3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\"></circle></svg></span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Stablecoin screening</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:8px 0 0\">Wallet addresses and on-chain flows screened before USDC and USDT are accepted or sent.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#EEEDFB;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B2ED3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Trained people</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:8px 0 0\">Staff are trained on AML, fraud and data handling, with a dedicated compliance function.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#EEEDFB;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B2ED3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Records you can audit</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:8px 0 0\">Every onboarding decision and payment is recorded and retained for review.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">What happens to every payment<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h2>\n<div style=\"margin-top:32px;padding:clamp(20px,3vw,32px);border-radius:28px;background:#fff;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px;min-width:780px\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;padding:20px;border-radius:20px;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#131126;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px\">01</span><b style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">Created</b><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;opacity:.85\">Your team or API creates the payment</span></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;padding:20px;border-radius:20px;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#131126;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px\">02</span><b style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">Approved</b><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;opacity:.85\">Rules and approvers you set release it</span></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;padding:20px;border-radius:20px;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#131126;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px\">03</span><b style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">Screened</b><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;opacity:.85\">Sanctions and risk checks run</span></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;padding:20px;border-radius:20px;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#131126;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px\">04</span><b style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">Delivered</b><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;opacity:.85\">Paid on the local rail by a licensed partner</span></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;padding:20px;border-radius:20px;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;color:#3B2ED3;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px\">05</span><b style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">Recorded</b><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;opacity:.85\">Status and reference kept for audit</span></div>\n</div></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><div style=\"padding:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);border-radius:28px;background:#fff;border:2px dashed #B4B1D0\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#3B2ED3;margin-bottom:12px\">LICENCES AND PARTNERS · TO COMPLETE</div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Regulators and banking partners<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h2><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:16px 0 0;max-width:60ch\">Add each licence or registration (regulator, licence type, number, jurisdiction) and each banking partner here before publishing.</p></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Controls you set<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h2><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 440px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:0\">Roles and permissions</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Decide who can view, create and approve payments.</p></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:0\">Approval thresholds</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Require one or more approvers above amounts you choose.</p></div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 440px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:0\">Allow-lists</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Limit which recipients your team, or your AI agents, can pay.</p></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 200px;display:grid\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:0\">Audit trail</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Every action is recorded with who did it and when.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(80px,10vw,140px)\"><div style=\"border-radius:28px;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff;padding:clamp(36px,6vw,80px);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:0;max-width:14ch\">Talk to our compliance team<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h2></div><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"padding:16px 28px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#fff;color:#3B2ED3\" class=\"dp-16y87us\">Talk to sales</a></div></section>\n\n</div>"
